  "summary_en": "Japanese ministerial ordinance (1998, revised effective 20 Oct 2026) setting procedures for type designation of specified vehicle equipment under the Road Transport Vehicle Act. It lists covered devices, including automated driving systems and cybersecurity systems, application and quality-control requirements, and recognition of UN regulation approvals.",
